{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1233,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c043407e069fd6b0721f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨的新鲜空气真的很棒，\r\n做什么事都能专心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3471cd3a8ba8fef7ea854ce654dc7b2869c5fa3c94b68594d89496a1d3f4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8f29047fb7510fa170e7e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论我多么早起，\r\n都一定会遇到有人在晨练。\r\n真不愧是特雷森学园。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d67a09b7ab88fd3d6b9013d8d9174d4c71f8d79ec1e27501e456176a9a844843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000a82870132d628f93c39f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔来喝个下午茶如何？\r\n我会用目白家传授的礼仪规范\r\n来招待你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ac969882e81b1ceb7375f83f881b3027da6790c790ee32511d92660295899b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd25e67e39d4f38dff984195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃完午餐后，\r\n帝王就立刻到操场去了。\r\n……我也不能输。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18dd2642451e35b7a23f0843293a5b2c3b93550c622a880b5eea04e6f4a08856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61c410c485d42b2010069fcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你努力到这么晚呀。\r\n我也必须学习你的精神才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88aa96fa9db689a49846e5dba6d76bdbc7524eb3976c34a00423722ea5efe091",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23aac67bb4d40e2f321d1a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就寝前我会涂上花香护手霜。\r\n感觉那样能让我稍微作个好梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f5ec499916cca0280ef5c72def814018d4b48c8dc9e75873673138030c2e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c82d1677b9133732811fc0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "百花齐放的春天……\r\n让人自然而然地抬头挺胸呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2752a6491676d82ef9cc3d567f8501ae5ff1bf700e9cfde708d82b0ad173beeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af9c1e91c953af034b935b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又到了阵雨纷纷的季节……\r\n赛道会变得满是泥泞，\r\n真叫人伤脑筋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0bd78e7be758f462914c2edf6241e3032d14ab17b6c3b87118f72fae2b929d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7b838649e010a2fac468e22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天冷时，我就会想念目白家的温泉。\r\n这个时节可以在露天温泉\r\n欣赏红叶哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf8f86608b618a5a96d86ab8f2e276dc1a87b6b58198d3a851b134409d6ff72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45dd86f5a4edeb3dd4851489",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦～♪\r\n觉得冷的时候，\r\n就给热柠檬水加一点蜂蜜……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da58491da6c69dbdb1bc174480913685c54b8c4186fef0f11bf040d3e8ada05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d88536135a6354643488748",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5238c1fda1b78b40ed448fa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950fb5359c36611f89321a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上练跑时巧遇帝王……\r\n看来我跑得有点太久了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "397b35de7317e175480745778cb0986d6cdc22f9636e66f1d6c24eb09d2c1764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38275f01482d452c4d0d56a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雷恩传了张照片过来，\r\n说海边的晨曦很美……\r\n呵呵，她的笑容也很棒呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b0e65a7f1ba832438519902de312b03f57ee0096891769ebec09f93bd16241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ec725d3276d1a1fa0132a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我记得今天的下午茶点心，\r\n是顶级的意式冰淇淋……\r\n我、我真的没有特别期待啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dceeb6f6265f67bebc85192b4beb20a181a168d4f5d26b2f1df2354afddab40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5afc71cb82d65d6c94c4a61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟多伯、阿尔丹的\r\n服装品味很类似……\r\n偶尔会挑中相同款式呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "766cb099d1eb461992c7cfc951fb3b149113981868b961f9d72b609f8863d6b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d5ac8b305539362d36cc29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太想满身大汗地回寝室。\r\n那个、你想想……\r\n这样会让生野很困扰的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88568ffb30e7ade93ed7bd415fb04445e8687aae2df2e93fdd39a32e59fe3389",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:529bb89203fa1dfade95d77e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「你今天也很努力呢。」\r\n以前，我常一边听着母亲\r\n这样赞美我，一边入睡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5601fbe99f64e27f1643588dbcaa2fe52e6ae44426ea828e49b461459af2b8f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4db62d76577b30b35494dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「春季」……果然光是听到这个词\r\n就会令人绷紧神经。\r\n……出发吧，在樱花凋谢之前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69ea4438be3298a2332814172d879160e5706106a20d9ccad297cc9b31f90964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e20b42096063dc20e6c4976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去凉爽的地方玩？\r\n那个……我正好买了\r\n一套合适的服装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f41687fa75c9664b1737617baf748db601ccad3fe663abb97b4632c25fb152fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4788c9bb43f157837391ecd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？最近，\r\n蜂蜜特饮店正在贩卖期间限定的\r\n「蜂蜜地瓜圣代」喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d84e11bf47fe137044cf8264d8ca2ca1dc10834ccf082d8d5516fe596beb964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee1a20ed1e7d0723bbdcdf45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不可思议，比赛中总会\r\n不自觉地忘记寒冷。\r\n这算是赛马娘七大不可思议之一吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cdecfc143d24e041036d404d7986f38fd101c3daade8445dd22feb7e6db9929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff493d4a7ebc218a7fd46a2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd16938888e6bfe278b29d7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才黄金船突然在我面前\r\n跳起了哥萨克舞……\r\n到底是什么意思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "484cbc6fee5b2aa5b9fb403f7a1ec88f6fe4034dfd576c1b3d9ea56349b97c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e33ad0e37d6f2d58bd79b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自助形式的食堂\r\n真的让人很难节制呢……\r\n唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b6753375ac08d9d5326526c8412e50c4cea8525f702c9b5ae4f8f3fd2fa8d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392c980d97c6c9a35b4ceb83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟周围的人必须有礼貌地打招呼，\r\n因为在目白家都是这么做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e46cbd71b1f4beaf6ba2acd38a714722e2bc19e3774e722c9891167784510c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c690d7d21065066353e2df59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真的很佩服帝王积极的态度。\r\n但我还是希望她有时能冷静一点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "445ee1d5e7c6b7715697808405de0c8b4b32c4117a454ffa0d6f1a6a389b7a2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:480c014796ad863b6393248f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天开电视的时候\r\n正好在转播体育赛事……！\r\n咳，没事，请当我什么都没说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af89c1381090401bf1a26aa83f61c399c5c4380a4055d23236e38a2cb664fae8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc155ac57767693bc9ec9817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果只执着于眼前的胜利\r\n是很容易失足的。\r\n不该只注重结果，过程也得重视。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8973265c9948382be7bbc4c3ff32549bf53085cc15c7fd472c8a2276442fc30a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48c4089f5138bd6052b6efad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里有很多可以互相切磋的对手呢。\r\n要好好珍惜这样的环境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c65355c262abd345e84edc229f1139565e5e072c42372d311518963e7fffe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c641bbfcc412a30ed70d4379",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要穿着这套决胜服取胜，\r\n来证明目白家并非浪得虚名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e9e85b18ae19e12442ba21797958213c0f66a20842169ab2c69d60b2495535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd738ad8bfc9fa7ed9a09a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了达成夙愿、光耀目白家门楣……\r\n一旦穿上决胜服\r\n就会感到决心变得更加坚定呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcee8895a62828757007b6fdaa519404082a54836d2b2e43c9fe53e592523e57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39625eac3f79b38f90efcfd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "整理服装仪容是每天的基本工作。\r\n每天早上我都会仔细地整理，\r\n绝不会顶着睡乱的头发出门。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56d3baf6b14bb36660e2c881fe677e6d955fbb95bdf86bea5d2be967e7e1a9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6ca121108abe5d1eed5efb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为小栗帽也在的关系……\r\n我不小心受她影响\r\n多吃了一份午餐的甜点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0607cb41b9d059e36177519787e0370c41775aace3bb34656f06eda62332d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405c914bc359c8c5626fa22a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "课堂作业的复习是不可欠缺的。\r\n若是在考试前感到焦虑，\r\n就太失目白家的水平了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1509d629648983cbe5b81f32367febca58ea66fbde67f724d589312ceb397762",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4a8dc11933ee52dd9d068bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向多伯推荐带有春天气息的\r\n花朵发饰，但她却完全听不进去……\r\n一定会很适合来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0bf39d76ba5e44334f66811539cd781f6048038fb406cf1d6d2a8fb6043a2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ff7cf5eb86840a30c9c907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都有在注意防晒。\r\n可不能让我的皮肤\r\n变粗糙或发炎啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24852bc2ba0ba218c64f08c5ef5eb3abf0565f91859bd52cf9f6c0d81501051e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a755733384d5fcf8d3726f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的甜点特辑……！\r\n唔唔，虽然很想看，但又不想看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e65c6c8d9239821d4bbbcc1d605895dae9327e53d8f20c17f67d7a31d22d65e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e100b71f3af9261c5f8e95b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要小心不要受寒感冒──阿嚏！\r\n这、这只是普通的喷嚏而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c537e08a519848d5ffb53ab10a1e6a75c088a63b0acbe2ad4df0c7b12b993c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dac5ebfcf505a38328e67de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看生野那样，她可是个很\r\n热情的人。我找她讨论健康管理\r\n有时甚至会聊到深夜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fedf944c6f8b5067270813e32d701acc17a14ec74bf2b7b75b4290b32fd11aef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916160ba0d1b16dc5b617755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的人\r\n常常会找善信倾诉烦恼。\r\n大家都被她的开朗所拯救了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0df2deb15af2bacdcd0e9beb1c704da2e7709f41a0c9b3e53ef7706fa14c1c0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d86e74d1e8ef2221fdf2ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我时常听不懂\r\n太阳神所说的话……\r\n『Azamaru水产』到底是……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "720e859acf549cd27be39fcd9825dfe61f0f1c7f9ecfb44426a877530b636453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2ca95ed34f197076ad5420f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当我在找弄掉的手帕时，\r\n米浴她主动前来协助我。\r\n……她真的很善良。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9bea3c7452466a6fc4c1b155a28fba0d2507d41948a6aaee8ef8d2c64141712",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee70d16fb8851d8c63ce3ead",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王好像没什么精神……\r\n不然我介绍目白家的主治医生\r\n给她看看好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36779cb769a332290e39115fbc625437dcfea9d07598a95503e4f60de0b9f0c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0faf9bf28a6a286995417d01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王真是的，一大早就在我面前\r\n吃着干酪满满的吐司……！\r\n我可是绝对不会被蛊惑的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd7217621410f005eb4964bae7779d52b74fb74b63ece457b7cf4447b949bfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3cee43a38cc433c69ffd30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，那朵云的形状好像胡萝卜……\r\n呵呵，真是可爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e3bf903b351fb287a65e8e0f3b56fd787b4f071db7a32101dbb09a5165cba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ed48d60ab73c53bd7c674f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "趁现在联络父母……\r\n要是我没有定期联系，\r\n他们很快就会担心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce276e5536e2220063ce4900ba4e1128f4f1a2061e83baa19442b9e73c9dadfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad55db04d7e17722294839cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的庭园里有座很大的水池。\r\n我经常在一旁眺望着\r\n樱花掉落到水面的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9155dd2b89b55b9beec200cbc280d417713ce897c021e4c8108f4596a3fe3c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d89e6727661b18ba5ab781",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时期有夜间比赛──\r\n不，目白家的赛马娘\r\n不能到处闲晃玩耍……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb7ce390eb07365f900359ae12a5199aed522ec513b64142acb3f77f382d563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab2fe999302318b0bec71ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着树叶逐渐变色，\r\n就能感觉到渐浓的秋意。\r\n季节交替是很快的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6faccbd3cc089b40522598e67bc0e0e6d11ba38b7b68d8f7f7dbf72e624bfbfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85b4ed66d5640ddbca77fb84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我会拿胸针\r\n把手套别成左右一对。\r\n……因为我常常搞丢其中一只。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9019678979fb78548df5cca47ec8294bc50f3ce3de939b3c92a4fc8135b592ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:384d8d66c4041ac29da8e6f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉这套服装\r\n能让我冲向更高的巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ef74c07a55071a956402e4c5398603fa2b9c92f35491f77ca1e2d68676a82d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2246a3dedf70ba478963be1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全新的决胜服也代表着众人的期待。\r\n我必须努力表现，\r\n以免使得替我加油的各位蒙羞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db6cb5b149d8da6da120ca5fe09cd2ea1161a20568b41a647f0df34c2aa9903c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd805b4eedebfce689801e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然非常少见，但偶尔\r\n会有人把我跟黄金船搞混。\r\n……真是令人心情复杂！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40eadb6e38834b34309828c447b8b532ce0e99d754da158c025985e0953cd254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf4163b51a28124f37d11b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为目白家的赛马娘，\r\n要身怀荣耀并谨慎行事，\r\n有时则要……顺从心声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac0e9584b9d7a20b16906871d00210c2129700a855a680c15d4b2fdb5f30cda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71b710972cf17ca0f6127fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年夏季踏青我都玩得很愉快。\r\n甚至常常在结束后发现体重微增……\r\n真是丝毫不能大意呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02bfcd0f217ccaee2117f36a9b7c1c1c6e435dc17f8dbaaa9477568f6f8ce8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ab87ecf543ea49c759608a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到了刨冰大会的活动介绍传单！\r\n据说可以尽情放上各种水果喔！\r\n呵呵，真是期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8211e9477a77649de2180360d99f2239f9d6e6f72741e9d30d1a1419be4c5bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5de1cbc51b0d48bd6150f9f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有一次，善信带着我\r\n去了夏季音乐祭。\r\n挤沙丁鱼就是在形容那种场合吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8363fbe0397a00e7e699d9bb38037bd942e66ddb0497a73beea4f5a211898378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235ce607c73cbe3e0c61fd31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奶奶是这么教诲的，\r\n即使早晨也不能输给睡意，\r\n要抬头挺胸……呼啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2b7743b38139ea9020cca07749952302b008b8646b017dfa794228f9a8f5c4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c5a9b59a08cd02073d357d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我拿到质量很好的茶叶。\r\n是「哈洛丝」的限定期间茶叶，\r\n很适合用来搭配甜食。",
      "source_fingerprint": "719a9123b780ef46102d76a466766b5bf4ad99aef92936d0aae1eae368d2e3f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e149b0b557c0003a214b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哎呀？好像从哪里传来了\r\n烟火的声音……要不要去看看？\r\n……只要一下下，好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ffca8292c8392ea3eccd21db4dd2309d9678ed0cd0dec0f5934b5dac6bc3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dee5510fa3942f5ddef1020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种季节跑起外围真是格外舒畅。\r\n樱花瓣飞舞、油菜花飘香……\r\n下次要不要一起去散散步？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a669d584f2bcc8058c620f6452274853755e10928a24430924b7a57aa0aaf074",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00bae7b0d4c96f61a2c2fbe7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前阿尔丹的房间曾飞进一只迷途的\r\n萤火虫。不知为何我总觉得那萤火虫\r\n比在其他地方看到的都还要美丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd45f6f9deba10ec11d2e28feafe8a3fb49fe5ed0e5fcf1c3d83cf8e2eff3df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1fd749a0dffda66e518500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船朝着空中一直挖，\r\n说是要反向挖地瓜……\r\n我应不应该阻止她呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "946a9b550a6177eb2ba7eb26dd67a2deb687bd246baa409535b95fb8fb77473b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617907d4c2a2245a06743824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我可是目白家的赛马娘，\r\n才不会屈服于这点寒冷呢！\r\n……绝对不会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eae1a3fc3af51a85c176ccf68cd5c2dd96d1de149d0629f9b1fe495ea4004e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53689775ff739899abc804dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我选择了能遮住肚子的款式。\r\n那个……毕竟不怕一万\r\n只怕万一对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c4e2e49e429427ed7e0e8e0b9fcef55bead38ffba30b5ddb4a3b766100b67d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b597760f9cb7619f6a6e2c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不可思议，只要穿上这套服装\r\n就能感受到那一天的夏日天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1697072bd1dc2714275cbb07b172c84836f7660ac17420ec348ffb0608388b60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efc472813faa5e6b9d9bdf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了。\r\n可以下达指示了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "822433039b044819bcc9a920a299eb303a38089489695b34752681d786f616e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46c5f6e69edaad499de3960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e86cae696f7fc2eda901391a9d4edb3ab4b3cdac405206139ed97f813c57ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697a05a018d99c4787844fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我身为背负目白家荣耀的人，\r\n绝不会疏于每日的锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42a223b660dbe184029931ab124988f9bbfbef6e1095e1ea2511eb5d20a528a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e25d3458f9f1cb2b5eeb96d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要一步一步、\r\n一点一点地累积努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bbe70a5195b6d7ce0836b29214e73dc44ad06285285c48b5e0077cb348f1733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:702dcae75a2be456848866cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了有一天\r\n能够达成夙愿……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96cbc90508759c4e5b8a53c8b9681b5db67383651ae0e06598b710fc9e437836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbff111ff1a623efb5f7a190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说「早起的鸟儿有虫吃」，\r\n真想要好好利用早上的时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "571ffe3783d47285d0efaa1d5508cca754267d9cd1f1e837334f6540344c2e0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3715d9365554f773f36261a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经过不断地努力才走到了这一步。\r\n今后也要继续照这样持续锻炼才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66fa9e04215ddb46e16934d6c77565f142a8ad9f39d0c6e0c5aa4a8aa74598a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6c6d1260831b41de3e5a17d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要穿着这套决胜服取胜，\r\n来证明目白家并非浪得虚名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75e9e85b18ae19e12442ba21797958213c0f66a20842169ab2c69d60b2495535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de7672d615c024be5387408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "严苛的训练我也会撑住，\r\n不然是没办法取胜的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ca45ead3d2d41367927a3c34f4e08a2647763df01ff89f7215f7c134085355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420109c5375c057e2bffca8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了接近理想的跑法，\r\n今天也要请你多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9751767aea96be4c6161defd081b6af25dd44cff092d6eaa3938888ec91d33ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3129770a0334c0aad3300e86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你应该明白什么样的训练\r\n才能发挥我的长处吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c59bec3eadc17490b47e91482711da6d7bb651c1729b51fbe01a7e81a8adf9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905ae931c3b23766e03a96d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宛如水鸟一般，强悍又优雅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe76a99e44b3636d5e8ae5310fb18af4bff38cdf6c18a56c47ed0fb95f70029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dc7572e9ff4187c09f994d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们振翅高飞，\r\n迈向胜利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4908ccb317d2fc3fe617df7a9e55b4b1ad68018d89403c007cd2bf9ae115f532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "92018"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
